# Azog, Moria's Ruin: "Its controller amasses Goblins X." The player who amasses puts the +1/+1 counters on their Army (CR 701.47a,
# 122.6), not Azog's controller. Bot2 has Innkeeper's Talent at level 3 ("If you would put one or more counters on a permanent or
# player, put twice that many ... instead") and a Memnite (power 1). Bot1's Azog destroys the Memnite; Bot2 creates a Goblin Army
# and puts the counter on it, so its Talent doubles it: two +1/+1 counters, a 2/2. Were Bot1 the one putting it, it would be one.

